  "description": "EGEYEV crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C102 H135 La6 N53 O59 6+,9(Br1 1-),3(H3 O1 1+),25(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La3 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La4 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La5 (La) has 9 O neighbors; La6 (La) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 3 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.875-4.060 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.82-110.61°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula (H3O)3{[La4(OH)8(H2O)2(IN)2(IN@CB[6])2][La(H2O)7(HIN)][La(H2O)8]}Br9·25H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 8 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 7 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 8 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
